    "id": "thm:cp-correspondence-coverage",
    "kind": "theorem",
    "statement": "Under independent sampling, for every \\(P_{\\mathrm{obs}}\\in\\mathfrak P_{\\mathrm{IV}}\\), \\(P_{\\mathrm{obs}}\\{Q_x^*(p_x)\\subseteq\\widehat{\\mathcal Q}_{x,n}(\\alpha)\\text{ for all }x\\in\\mathcal X\\}\\geq1-\\alpha\\). The active-basis algorithm computes exactly the union in the definition, including zero-count cells and laws on intersections of optimal faces; the coverage statement is finite-sample and uniform over \\(\\mathfrak P_{\\mathrm{IV}}\\).",
    "free_symbols": [
      "P_{\\mathrm{obs}}",
      "\\mathfrak P_{\\mathrm{IV}}",
      "Q_x^*(p_x)",
      "p_x",
      "\\widehat{\\mathcal Q}_{x,n}(\\alpha)",
      "n",
      "\\alpha",
      "\\mathcal X"
    ],
